    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Carmen Lalonde",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111844956711658860639/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJc7NHh6vr3CPGONtaJ6too1h0GpgEnhb1YSYF2eKA0JrHbDQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I lived at Le Picardie in the Dorion area of Vaudreuil-Dorion…on the side close to the highway 20.\nI have to say that it was a great experience!  I truly enjoyed my stay there. The apartment that I had was beautiful and well lit, with many,  huge windows.  The staff was always polite and professional.  Anything that I needed was promptly addressed and resolved. They are a great company. Happy to recommend them and their building Le Picardie.  Thank you again!!!",
        "time": 1743611487,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melissa Ridley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106569232900262295648/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8Sn4-bn7NG6cKXXSpFdzhybk10P7IXR5LxUs11jOEQT2kHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I had a major water leak this week above the breaker box  Frank and Sebastian showed up as soon as they could to assess the damage the next morning the repair crew was on sits\n\nGreat communication. I appreciated that they explained to me the game plan for the remainder of the repairs.",
        "time": 1761270445,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Elkanah Shekari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110941809991002634092/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRuVV2dayexKBkXHaFdlTN9JZIDwZqB0L1xwOAp4sqmjljt1g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I lived in an apartment building managed by Multilogements Chez Toit for many years. From my experience, I sincerely appreciated the management’s communication and consideration of its tenants. Living a conflict-free life in any community is almost impossible, but I think what matters most is how someone navigates the terrain of conflict. Julie is great, and I am thankful for her understanding, wisdom and patience in managing Multilogements Chez Toit's business and the community life of my apartment. Well done!\nAlso, Sam (whom I call ‘boss’) and his workers are wonderful guys. When there is any need for renovations or little fixes, I find them respectful and professional in what they do—well done, boys!\nMy family was happy in our apartment and satisfied during our time with this management. The owners are good people! I hope your experience is like mine or even better.",
        "time": 1695607776,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Оксана Богдан",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109118093226501981111/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvYnJAsqgmJjW6K86RcFClneOSWBc6fT6UIxkPxVsiB9wn5Q4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Two years ago, I came to Canada from Ukraine, with my kids and without my husband. I was in a big stress because I did not know anybody here: new place, new people. My first question was where will I live with my kids and my mom, as this is a new country for me and I don’t know anyone to help me find an apartment for me and my kids.\n\nOne day, walking on the street with my mom I saw Multilogements Chez Toit. I remember that day, my mom told me to just go in and explain my situation, they could possibly help me. Yes, these people helped me a lot! Julie and Rosalie listened to me and understood my situation .They took the time to find an apartment, organize it, work on it and fit it into their already crazy schedule. All this required a lot of efforts and time, for someone, just a stranger, whom they have not met before and did not expect that one day someone would come into their office and make them change their already full schedule. But despite all this, these people recognized me in my situation and helped me step by step! It took 3-4 days to find an apartment. 100% professional and fast, organization and work!\n\nMme Julie gave me a chance and provided an apartment for free for 4 months. I remember her words like if it were yesterday: “we will not leave you, you need time, everything will be fine”. After 4 months, which was enough time to make some savings and pay for the rent, Mme Julie found a place that corresponds to my financial situation and I now rent an apartment.\n\nI am really grateful for their help and the trust that Mme Julie put in me, without knowing my background. For her I was just a stranger from another country, coming in her office one day…",
        "time": 1708026378,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105206218692271882434/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwmHJftWlmqeThhjSVVyCViDjrvCOvCH_zchG0Qj6MU69tCg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "ONLY GOOD TO TAKE YOUR RENT MONEY!!\nThey make you sign a contract but no one in the building respects it (dogs when youre not allowed, loud noise at all hours, smoking weed and cigarettes inside and owners dont care) and they don’t help you if you have issues and give you the run around to get answers. They dont answer their phones and will only communicate by email (unless its to take your money, then you bet they answer) even if you ask to be called, they will ignore you. Worst customer service ive ever seen\n\nThey fooled me, I thought they were professional and would respect their tenants but they only care about the money so watch out!!",
        "time": 1621965988,
        "translated": false
      }
